# Environment
# .env.production is the FILE ACTUALLY IN USE on the box and holds every secret
# (Supabase service role, Anthropic, Mandrill, the GA4 MP api_secret). Only
# `.env.production.local` was ignored, so the real one was merely untracked —
# one `git add -A` on the box away from being committed. Added 2026-09-11.
.env
.env.local
.env.development.local
.env.test.local
.env.production
.env.production.local
# Timestamped env backups taken before edits — same contents, same risk.
.env*.bak*
.env.production.bak*

# Logs
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
logs/
*.log

